  ('PBM-CAP-001', 'API Batch Quality Evidence Review', 'Reviews and controls quality evidence for Active Pharmaceutical Ingredient batches. This includes batch records, test results, deviations, approvals, and release-supporting documents to ensure the batch can be assessed against GMP and quality requirements.', 1),
  ('PBM-CAP-002', 'API Deviation, OOS and CAPA Evidence Control', 'Manages evidence related to API manufacturing deviations, out-of-specification results, investigations, root causes, corrective actions, and preventive actions. The capability ensures investigation records are complete, traceable, and ready for QA or regulatory review.', 2),
  ('PBM-CAP-003', 'Finished Dose BMR/BPR Packaging Variance and Release Packet Control', 'Controls batch manufacturing records, batch packaging records, packaging variances, reconciliation evidence, and final release documentation for finished dosage products. It ensures all production and packaging evidence supports safe batch release.', 3),
  ('PBM-CAP-004', 'Stability Study Follow-Up and Change-Control Impact Packet Control', 'Tracks stability study follow-ups, test outcomes, trends, missed pulls, excursions, and related change-control impacts. This capability ensures stability evidence is complete and linked to product quality decisions.', 4),
  ('PBM-CAP-005', 'Biological Product Batch and Comparability Evidence Control', 'Manages batch evidence for biological products and supports comparability assessments after process, site, material, or method changes. It ensures product quality, consistency, and change impact evidence are properly documented.', 5),
  ('PBM-CAP-006', 'Vaccine Lot QC, Temperature-Excursion and Cold-Chain Release Packet Control', 'Controls vaccine lot quality records, QC test evidence, cold-chain logs, temperature excursions, investigations, and release-supporting packets. This capability ensures vaccine lots are assessed for quality and storage compliance before release.', 6),
  ('PBM-CAP-007', 'Advanced Biopharma Evidence Inventory and Authority-Boundary Triage', 'Organizes evidence for advanced biopharma products and identifies which issues need specialist, QA, regulatory, clinical, or authority-level escalation. It helps learners/workers separate routine documentation from high-risk or authority-bound decisions.', 7),
  ('PBM-CAP-008', 'Clinical Trial Startup Records and Monitoring Action Evidence Control', 'Manages clinical trial startup documentation, site readiness records, ethics/regulatory submissions, monitoring findings, action items, and follow-up evidence. This ensures trial startup and site monitoring activities are inspection-ready.', 8),
  ('PBM-CAP-009', 'Pharmacovigilance ICSR and Safety Evidence Handling', 'Handles Individual Case Safety Reports and supporting safety evidence. This includes intake, seriousness checks, case documentation, follow-up tracking, coding support, and timely handoff for pharmacovigilance processing.', 9),
  ('PBM-CAP-010', 'Clinical Dataset Mapping, Query Reconciliation and Data-Lock Packet Control', 'Controls clinical data evidence during dataset mapping, query tracking, reconciliation, and data-lock preparation. It ensures clinical data issues are resolved, documented, and ready for analysis or regulatory submission.', 10),
  ('PBM-CAP-011', 'NGS Run QC, Variant Calling and Genomics Reporting', 'Manages next-generation sequencing run quality checks, variant calling outputs, QC flags, interpretation support evidence, and genomics reporting packets. This capability ensures genomic test results are evidence-based, traceable, and review-ready.', 11),
  ('PBM-CAP-012', 'Bioservices Sample Result, Assay Run and Research Tool Lot Evidence Control', 'Controls sample testing records, assay run evidence, result documentation, reagent/tool lot records, and research service outputs. This supports reliable bioservices delivery and traceable laboratory evidence.', 12),
  ('PBM-CAP-013', 'Biofoundry DBTL Cycle Evidence Execution', 'Executes and records evidence across the Design-Build-Test-Learn cycle in a biofoundry environment. This includes experiment design inputs, build records, test outputs, learning notes, and iteration evidence.', 13),
  ('PBM-CAP-014', 'Industrial Bioprocess Scale-Up and Product Evidence Handoff', 'Manages evidence during bioprocess scale-up from lab or pilot stage to larger production scale. It includes process parameters, batch observations, yield data, deviations, and handoff documents for manufacturing or tech transfer.', 14),
  ('PBM-CAP-015', 'Agri-Biotech Trait, Field Trial and Stewardship Evidence Packet Control', 'Controls evidence related to biotech traits, field trials, agronomic observations, trial deviations, stewardship obligations, and performance records. This supports responsible agri-biotech product development and review.', 15),
  ('PBM-CAP-016', 'Agri-Biotech License-to-Operate Evidence Coordination', 'Coordinates documents and evidence needed for agri-biotech regulatory, environmental, stewardship, biosafety, and market authorization requirements. This capability supports compliance and continued permission to operate.', 16),
  ('PBM-CAP-017', 'Medical Device Technical File, QMS and Post-Market Evidence Control', 'Manages medical device technical files, quality management system records, risk documentation, complaints, vigilance, and post-market surveillance evidence. It ensures device documentation remains audit- and compliance-ready.', 17),
  ('PBM-CAP-018A', 'Device QC Test Report and Biomedical Equipment Nonconformance Packet Control', 'Controls quality test reports, equipment inspection records, failed test evidence, nonconformance reports, investigation notes, and disposition packets for medical devices or biomedical equipment.', 18),
  ('PBM-CAP-018B', 'IVD Performance, Diagnostic Evidence and PMS Packet Control', 'Manages in-vitro diagnostic performance evidence, analytical/clinical validation support, diagnostic result evidence, complaints, and post-market surveillance records. This ensures IVD products are supported by traceable performance and safety evidence.', 19),
  ('PBM-CAP-018C', 'SaMD Lifecycle, V&V and Cybersecurity Evidence Index Control', 'Controls evidence for Software as a Medical Device across lifecycle documentation, verification and validation, risk controls, cybersecurity evidence, change records, and release-supporting indexes.', 20),
