  ('TLS-CAP-029', 'Food/Dairy Cold-Chain Receiving & Temperature Release', 'Temperature logger, reefer status and product batch; Logger trace and product temperature threshold; Excursion evidence and product batch; Cold-room inventory and receiving checklist; Cold-chain receiving and temperature release record', 29),
  ('TLS-CAP-030', 'Reefer Dispatch & Excursion Response', 'Reefer pre-cool record, logger assignment and route plan; Dispatch manifest and route timing; Pre-cool/logger exception evidence; Logger alert and route delay status; Reefer dispatch and excursion action record', 30),
  ('TLS-CAP-031', 'Pharma GDP Shipment Documentation Support', 'GDP distribution records, validated shipment records, deviation reports, temperature-monitoring logs, transport agreements; Validated shipment and monitoring record; QA release/deviation dependency; Logger data and deviation threshold; GDP shipment support checklist', 31),
  ('TLS-CAP-032', 'GDP Cold-Chain Deviation Evidence Support', 'Temperature logger data, biological shipment record and threshold; Biological shipment and movement instruction; Logger trace, validated lane, shipment record and consignee/quality contact; Deviation packet and GDP support checklist; Deviation support record', 32),
  ('TLS-CAP-033', '4PL Milestone Visibility & Exception Escalation', 'Shipment milestones, exception logs, vendor SLA records, inventory and service dashboards; Vendor status and SLA record; Vendor non-response exception; Customer SLA and exception reason; Control tower exception log', 33),
  ('TLS-CAP-034', 'Vendor SLA Recovery Coordination', 'Vendor SLA record, shipment examples and service-impact notes; Vendor variance and impacted shipment list; Vendor non-response and SLA breach evidence; Vendor recovery proposal and service-impact note; Vendor SLA coordination record', 34),
  ('TLS-CAP-035', 'Supply-Chain Cost & Service Analytics Review', 'Cost by mode, service level and exception trend; Vendor scorecard and SLA history; Lane cost, service and exception data; Draft recommendation and authority boundary; Optimization recommendation note', 35),
  ('TLS-CAP-036', 'Network Optimization Recommendation Handoff', 'Lane data, shipment volumes, service targets and vendor constraints; Lane data and service/cost assumptions; Network recommendation draft; Recommendation and authority exception; Network optimization support handoff', 36),
  ('CYB-CAP-CS-001', 'SOC Alert Triage and Escalation Control', 'Handles first-line review of SOC alerts by checking SIEM, EDR, network, identity, and ticket evidence, separating false positives from credible security events, assigning severity, and escalating validated incidents with enough context for response teams to act quickly.', 1),
  ('CYB-CAP-CS-002', 'Managed Response Coordination and SOC Handoff Support', 'Coordinates managed detection and response activity after an alert is accepted, keeping timelines, responder actions, customer updates, containment status, and handoff evidence aligned across SOC, MDR, customer IT, and incident-response teams.', 2),
  ('CYB-CAP-CS-003', 'Cloud Posture Risk and Guardrail Governance', 'Reviews cloud security posture across accounts, subscriptions, workloads, identities, storage, networking, and policy guardrails to identify misconfigurations, ownership gaps, exposure risks, and governance exceptions that need remediation or risk acceptance.', 3),
  ('CYB-CAP-CS-004', 'Cloud-Native Control Remediation', 'Supports remediation of cloud-native control gaps by validating the affected resource, checking service impact, applying or coordinating approved configuration fixes, and collecting evidence that the guardrail or security control is restored.', 4),
  ('CYB-CAP-CS-005', 'Application Scanner Triage and CI/CD Security Gate Control', 'Reviews SAST, DAST, SCA, secrets, and container scan findings in application delivery pipelines, validates severity and exploitability, routes actionable defects, and supports CI/CD security gates before code or images are promoted.', 5),
  ('CYB-CAP-CS-006', 'Product Threat Modeling and Security Handoff', 'Structures product threat modeling by identifying assets, trust boundaries, abuse cases, data flows, security assumptions, and unresolved design risks, then hands off clear control requirements to engineering, architecture, or AppSec reviewers.', 6),
  ('CYB-CAP-CS-007', 'IAM Lifecycle Access Control Execution', 'Executes identity and access lifecycle controls by validating joiner, mover, leaver, role-change, access request, and deprovisioning evidence against policy so user access stays appropriate, timely, and auditable.', 7),
  ('CYB-CAP-CS-008', 'PAM, IGA and SoD Governance Handling', 'Handles privileged access, identity governance, and segregation-of-duties evidence by checking elevated accounts, access certifications, SoD conflicts, ownership, approval trails, and remediation status for governance or audit review.', 8),
  ('CYB-CAP-CS-009', 'Cyber GRC Evidence and Control Mapping', 'Maps cybersecurity controls to policies, standards, audits, client requirements, or regulatory expectations by collecting evidence, checking control coverage, recording gaps, and preparing traceable packs for GRC review.', 9),
  ('CYB-CAP-CS-010', 'Technology Control Testing and Risk Disposition', 'Tests technology controls by checking design and operating effectiveness evidence, identifying failed or weak controls, documenting risk impact, and routing findings for remediation, acceptance, or management disposition.', 10),
  ('CYB-CAP-CS-011', 'OT Asset, Event and Plant-Impact Security Judgment', 'Assesses operational-technology security events by linking OT asset context, plant-process impact, safety sensitivity, network signal, and maintenance constraints so cyber alerts are judged without disrupting critical operations unnecessarily.', 11),
  ('CYB-CAP-CS-012', 'IT/OT Segmentation and Maintenance-Window Control', 'Supports IT/OT segmentation and maintenance-window control by validating zone boundaries, firewall or access changes, dependency risks, planned work evidence, and rollback readiness before network changes affect industrial environments.', 12),
  ('CYB-CAP-CS-013', 'Authorized Penetration Testing Evidence Production', 'Produces evidence for authorized penetration testing by confirming scope, rules of engagement, test windows, exploit evidence, affected assets, impact notes, and retest status while keeping activity inside approved legal and operational boundaries.', 13),
  ('CYB-CAP-CS-014', 'Vulnerability Lifecycle and Retest Closure Control', 'Controls the vulnerability lifecycle from detection to closure by validating findings, assigning ownership and priority, tracking remediation, checking exceptions, coordinating retests, and preserving evidence that risk was reduced or formally accepted.', 14),
  ('CYB-CAP-CS-015', 'BAS / Red-Team Scenario Control Review', 'Reviews breach-and-attack simulation or red-team scenario control by checking scenario purpose, authorization, target boundaries, telemetry capture, control response, business impact, and improvement actions after the exercise.', 15),
  ('ADS-CF-001', 'Aerostructure Manufacturing Support', 'Manufacturing support for aircraft structures, assemblies, interiors, composites/metallic structures and production evidence. Allowed scope: Production planning support, work instruction evidence, inspection records, part traceability, nonconformance support and supplier quality. Blocked scope: Proprietary process recipes, restricted defence platform details.', 1),
  ('ADS-CF-002', 'Aircraft Systems Assembly & Integration Documentation', 'Support for documented assembly and integration evidence across civil aircraft systems and components. Allowed scope: Interface records, integration checklists, evidence packs, QA records and configuration documentation. Blocked scope: Flight-critical algorithm design or proprietary OEM-only procedures.', 2),
  ('ADS-CF-019', 'Requirements & Interface Management', 'Requirements capture support, interface control documentation, requirement traceability and change evidence across ADS programs. Allowed scope: Requirements support, interface-control records, baseline documentation and traceability evidence. Blocked scope: Classified requirements or restricted interface behavior.', 3),
  ('ADS-CF-020', 'MBSE & Digital Thread Documentation Support', 'Model-based/digital-thread documentation support, architecture evidence and traceability artifacts without proprietary process lock-in. Allowed scope: Architecture documentation support, traceability links, model evidence review and digital-thread records. Blocked scope: Proprietary tool-specific workflows, classified models or restricted system behavior.', 4),
  ('ADS-CF-027', 'Cybersecurity Compliance & Resilience Evidence', 'Defensive cybersecurity documentation, compliance evidence, resilience records and secure configuration governance for ADS systems. Allowed scope: Secure documentation, cyber compliance support, resilience evidence and secure configuration governance. Blocked scope: Offensive cyber, exploitation, intrusion tactics, malware or attack instructions.', 5),
  ('ADS-CF-028', 'Advanced Manufacturing Process QA', 'QA support for composites, additive manufacturing, precision machining and electronics manufacturing methods used in ADS. Allowed scope: Process QA, inspection evidence, manufacturing readiness, traceability and nonconformance support. Blocked scope: Proprietary recipes and hazardous weapon/propulsion manufacturing details.', 6),
  ('ADS-CF-032', 'Technical Documentation & Data Package Control', 'Technical documentation, engineering data packages, controlled documents, revision records and release support. Allowed scope: Technical document control, revision logs, data-package completeness checks and release evidence. Blocked scope: Classified technical details or restricted operating instructions.', 7),
  ('ADS-CF-034', 'Materials & Composites Manufacturing Support', 'Materials, composites, bonding/layup evidence, inspection documentation and manufacturing readiness support at public-domain level. Allowed scope: Manufacturing support, process evidence, inspection records, nonconformance support and supplier quality. Blocked scope: Proprietary recipes, restricted material formulations, classified platform details.', 8),
  ('ADS-CF-021', 'Certification & Compliance Evidence Management', 'Certification support, compliance records, audit evidence and regulator/localization documentation across ADS. Allowed scope: Audit evidence, compliance matrices, certification support and localization records. Blocked scope: Unauthorized approval authority or bypassing regulator decisions.', 4),
  ('ADS-CF-022', 'Test, Verification, Validation & Qualification Evidence', 'Test planning support, verification evidence, validation records, qualification documentation and acceptance evidence. Allowed scope: Test documentation, V&V traceability, qualification support, acceptance evidence and closure records. Blocked scope: Restricted test procedures for weapons, EW, propulsion or hazardous launch systems.', 5),
  ('ADS-CF-024', 'Supplier Quality & Part Traceability', 'Supplier quality, part traceability, incoming inspection evidence, supplier corrective action and vendor quality records. Allowed scope: Supplier quality documentation, part traceability, inspection evidence, change records and corrective-action tracking. Blocked scope: Generic procurement unrelated to ADS traceability/quality.', 5),
  ('ADS-CF-025', 'Configuration & Change Control', 'Configuration baselines, change control documentation, release records and lifecycle data governance. Allowed scope: Baseline control, change records, release documentation, configuration audits and lifecycle records. Blocked scope: Classified configuration details or restricted interface behavior.', 7),
  ('ADS-CF-023', 'Mission Assurance, Reliability & Safety Evidence', 'Risk, reliability, safety, mission assurance and readiness evidence support. Allowed scope: Risk logs, safety evidence, reliability support, non-classified readiness documentation and assurance records. Blocked scope: Classified mission operations, restricted procedures or hazardous procedural instructions.', 7),
  ('ADS-CF-033', 'ADS Engineering Program Governance & Evidence Controls', 'ADS-specific engineering governance and evidence-control support covering requirements baseline tracking, engineering action tracking, risk and issue evidence, milestone readiness evidence, configuration board support, review-pack preparation, decision-log maintenance and cross-functional engineering coordination. Allowed scope: Requirements baseline tracking, engineering action tracking, risk and issue evidence, milestone readiness evidence, configuration board support, review-pack preparation, decision-log maintenance, and cross-functional engineering coordination. Blocked scope: Generic project management, commercial contract management, finance control, classified program decisions, tactical mission planning, and authority-level engineering approval.', 12),
  ('ADS-CF-031', 'Lifecycle Sustainment & Maintenance Support', 'Lifecycle sustainment planning, maintenance evidence, reliability support and supportability documentation across ADS platforms. Allowed scope: Maintenance support, sustainment documentation, service history, reliability evidence and lifecycle support records. Blocked scope: Tactical operations, restricted mission details or hazardous procedural instructions.', 12),
  ('ADS-CF-003', 'Aircraft MRO Planning & Technical Records', 'MRO planning, task-card evidence, maintenance records, spares documentation and technical records support. Allowed scope: Maintenance planning support, workpack documentation, spares traceability, technical records, inspection evidence. Blocked scope: Airline commercial operations, passenger handling or airport terminal operations.', 1),
  ('ADS-CF-004', 'Continuing Airworthiness & Inspection Support', 'Support for airworthiness evidence, inspection findings, compliance tracking and maintenance release documentation. Allowed scope: Audit evidence, inspection support, compliance records, defect evidence and corrective-action tracking. Blocked scope: Certification authority decision-making or unauthorized airworthiness approvals.', 2),
  ('ADS-CF-029', 'Ground Support Equipment Calibration & Readiness', 'Support for tooling, test rigs, GSE readiness, calibration evidence and maintenance/test infrastructure documentation. Allowed scope: Tooling readiness, test-rig documentation, calibration records, readiness checks and infrastructure maintenance records. Blocked scope: Hazardous launch/propulsion procedural instructions and restricted test operations.', 8),
  ('ADS-CF-005', 'Military Aircraft Platform Integration Governance', 'Public-domain support for military aircraft integration evidence, interface governance, QA and sustainment documentation. Allowed scope: Integration governance, interface documentation, V&V evidence, configuration records, supplier quality and sustainment support. Blocked scope: Classified mission tactics, combat employment, weapons-control logic or restricted interface behavior.', 1),
  ('ADS-CF-008', 'Defence Production QA & Safety Compliance', 'Public-domain QA, safety, compliance and production evidence support for defence production environments. Allowed scope: Inspection, safety compliance, configuration control, lifecycle support, supplier quality and non-sensitive production support. Blocked scope: Weapon design, guidance, seeker, targeting, warhead/energetics, firing logic and fire-control details.', 2),
  ('ADS-CF-006', 'UAV Assembly, Compliance & Lifecycle Support', 'Public, civil/non-weaponized UAV assembly, compliance documentation, payload interface evidence, maintenance and lifecycle support. Allowed scope: Assembly support, integration documentation, public payload interface documentation, test evidence, maintenance records, compliance records and operator-support documentation. Blocked scope: Weaponization, targeting, autonomous engagement, restricted payload methods, surveillance tactics, flight-control algorithms and defeat/avoidance methods.', 1),
  ('ADS-CF-030', 'Propulsion Systems Support - Controlled Boundary', 'Public-domain propulsion-system support, documentation, inspection, QA, supplier quality, safety compliance and lifecycle evidence. Allowed scope: Public propulsion support documentation, inspection, QA, supplier quality, integration evidence, test-readiness documentation, safety compliance and lifecycle support. Blocked scope: Propellant formulation, combustion design, engine build procedures, missile propulsion details, hazardous test procedures, thrust optimization and restricted operating procedures.', 7),
  ('ADS-CF-026', 'Safety-Critical / Embedded Software Traceability Support', 'Requirements, test evidence, configuration and documentation support for safety-critical/embedded software environments. Allowed scope: Requirements traceability, test evidence, configuration governance, integration support and documentation. Blocked scope: Restricted algorithms, weapons-control logic, flight-control algorithm details and classified mission software.', 7),
  ('ADS-CF-007', 'Counter-UAS Detection Support Governance', 'Public-domain support governance for detection, documentation, configuration and compliance evidence around counter-UAS environments. Allowed scope: Detection/support governance, integration documentation, test evidence, compliance documentation, lifecycle support, configuration control and supplier quality. Blocked scope: Jamming methods, defeat procedures, countermeasure tactics, technical neutralization, targeting and operational doctrine.', 1),
  ('ADS-CF-009', 'Land Platform Integration & Sustainment Support', 'Public-domain support for land-system integration evidence, sustainment records, QA and supplier quality. Allowed scope: Platform support, integration documentation, inspection evidence, sustainment records, supplier quality and configuration control. Blocked scope: Combat doctrine, tactics, restricted survivability methods or weapons employment.', 2),
  ('ADS-CF-010', 'Naval Platform Shipyard Integration Support', 'Shipyard integration support, QA, configuration control, lifecycle support and sustainment documentation for naval platforms. Allowed scope: Shipbuilding systems support, integration documentation, QA, configuration control and sustainment support. Blocked scope: Classified underwater warfare details, submarine tactics, restricted combat systems doctrine.', 2),
  ('ADS-CF-011', 'Defence Electronics & Mission Systems Integration Documentation', 'Public hardware/software integration documentation, QA, supplier quality and lifecycle support for defence electronics and mission systems. Allowed scope: Public integration documentation, test evidence, QA, lifecycle support, configuration control and supplier quality. Blocked scope: Weapon-control logic, restricted algorithms, classified interface behavior, mission-effect optimization, operational effects, tactical use and classified mission profiles.', 1),
  ('ADS-CF-035', 'Electronics Manufacturing & Harness Assembly Support', 'Electronics manufacturing, cable/harness assembly support, inspection evidence and configuration documentation for ADS systems. Allowed scope: Assembly support, inspection evidence, wiring/harness documentation, configuration control and supplier quality. Blocked scope: Restricted electronics design, classified interface behavior or weapon-control logic.', 8),
  ('ADS-CF-012', 'Radar, Sensor & Command-System Lifecycle Governance', 'Lifecycle governance for public-domain radar, sensor, communication and command/control system support evidence. Allowed scope: Public system support, integration documentation, test documentation, QA, maintenance, lifecycle support, configuration control and supplier quality. Blocked scope: ISR mission planning, targeting logic, classified signatures, signal exploitation, sensor performance tactics, intelligence workflows and operational doctrine.', 1),
  ('ADS-CF-013', 'EW Equipment Documentation & Configuration Support', 'EW equipment documentation support, configuration control, QA, inspection, lifecycle maintenance support and compliance evidence. Allowed scope: Equipment documentation support, configuration control, QA/inspection, lifecycle maintenance support, test evidence management, supplier quality and compliance documentation. Blocked scope: Jamming methods, signal exploitation, countermeasure design, emissions analysis, threat-library handling and operational EW tactics.', 1),
  ('ADS-CF-014', 'Launch System Integration & Readiness Support', 'Public-domain launch-system integration support, flight-readiness evidence, safety compliance and lifecycle documentation. Allowed scope: Integration support, verification evidence, launch-readiness documentation, safety compliance, lifecycle support and supplier quality. Blocked scope: Hazardous detailed manufacturing/operating instructions, restricted launch procedures and propulsion technical details.', 1),
  ('ADS-CF-015', 'Spacecraft AIT & Product Assurance', 'Spacecraft assembly, integration and test support with product assurance, configuration and verification evidence. Allowed scope: AIT support, verification evidence, product assurance, documentation, configuration control and lifecycle support. Blocked scope: Classified payload design, surveillance payload tasking, defence-space payload effects, restricted sensor performance logic and operational intelligence use.', 1),
  ('ADS-CF-016', 'Payload Manufacturing Support & Verification Evidence', 'Public-domain payload manufacturing support, verification evidence and product assurance documentation. Allowed scope: Manufacturing support, AIT support, verification evidence, product assurance, documentation, configuration control and lifecycle support. Blocked scope: Classified payload design, surveillance payload tasking, defence-space payload effects, restricted sensor performance logic and operational intelligence use.', 2),
  ('ADS-CF-017', 'Ground Segment Operations Support Evidence', 'Ground-segment infrastructure support, operations evidence, station/support-system readiness, communication-support documentation and lifecycle governance. Allowed scope: Ground-segment infrastructure support, operations evidence, station/support-system readiness, communication-support documentation and lifecycle governance. Blocked scope: Classified mission profiles, restricted command procedures, operational intelligence and defence-space mission details.', 1),
  ('ADS-CF-036', 'Public Space Mission Scheduling & Anomaly Evidence Support', 'Public mission scheduling, anomaly logging, anomaly evidence packaging, escalation documentation, non-classified mission-status evidence and operations support governance. Allowed scope: Public mission scheduling, anomaly logging, anomaly evidence packaging, escalation documentation, non-classified mission-status evidence and operations support governance. Blocked scope: Ground-station infrastructure maintenance, classified command procedures, spacecraft commanding, restricted mission operations, operational intelligence use, classified mission planning and defence-space operations.', 8),
  ('ADS-CF-018', 'Space Downstream Data Services Support', 'Support for public/non-sensitive downstream space data services, product operations and service documentation. Allowed scope: Data product support, service documentation, quality checks, customer workflow support and compliance evidence for public applications. Blocked scope: Operational intelligence use, classified surveillance tasking, targeting workflows or restricted sensor exploitation.', 1),
  ('LFA-CAP-SUB001-SAMPLE', 'Finished Leather Shade, Finish, Recipe, and Buyer Sample Approval Capability', 'Learner can check buyer shade card, finish trial, recipe sheet, lot card, and sample comments using shade matching card; tannery recipe sheet; drum processing log to produce approved leather sample correction note and buyer approval handoff while identifying shade variation, thickness deviation, surface defect, finish mismatch, or missing lot identity and escalating to leather technologist, tannery QA, production owner, or buyer coordinator.', 1),
  ('LFA-CAP-SUB001-MAKE', 'Tannery Batch, Drum Log, Chemical Inventory, and Finishing Line Control Capability', 'Learner can verify tannery batch identity, drum process entries, recipe references, chemical inventory, and finishing line status using drum processing log; tannery recipe sheet; chemical inventory register to produce updated tannery batch record, finishing-line WIP status, and QA handoff while identifying chemical batch mismatch, process deviation, shade drift, traceability gap, or finishing defect and escalating to tannery production supervisor, QA, compliance owner, or production head.', 2),
  ('LFA-CAP-SUB001-QA', 'Leather Lab Testing, Traceability, ETP, and Restricted Substance Release Capability', 'Learner can inspect lot card, shade/thickness evidence, traceability file, ETP evidence, and restricted-substance support using shade matching card; ETP daily log; chemical inventory register to produce hold/release recommendation with compliance evidence and buyer release note while identifying failed test result, traceability break, chemical/MRSL gap, ETP evidence gap, or shade mismatch and escalating to QA manager, compliance owner, buyer coordinator, or production owner.', 3),
  ('LFA-CAP-SUB001-MERCH', 'Finished Leather Buyer Comment, Order Documentation, and Export Handoff Capability', 'Learner can coordinate buyer comments, order reference, sample approval record, and export-document readiness using shade matching card; ETP daily log; chemical inventory register to produce closed buyer comment status, order file update, and export handoff pack while identifying unclosed buyer comment, wrong shade/order reference, missing test evidence, or incomplete export document and escalating to finished leather merchandiser, QA, compliance owner, or export documentation coordinator.', 4),
  ('LFA-CAP-SUB001-SUST', 'Leather Traceability, Chemical Evidence, and Environmental Compliance Support Capability', 'Learner can compile traceability, chemical inventory, ETP, and restricted-substance evidence for benchmark compliance support using chemical inventory register; ETP daily log; drum processing log to produce controlled compliance evidence pack and escalation note while identifying missing chemical batch reference, incomplete ETP entry, traceability gap, or unsupported MRSL evidence and escalating to QA manager, compliance owner, or buyer coordinator.', 5),
  ('LFA-CAP-SUB002-SAMPLE', 'Footwear Last, CAD Pattern, Upper, Outsole, and Buyer Sample Approval Capability', 'Learner can review last specification, CAD pattern, upper material, outsole, trim, and buyer sample comments using footwear CAD pattern file; upper stitching line plan; lasting and sole bonding log to produce corrected footwear sample evidence and buyer approval handoff while identifying wrong last, size, upper material, sole, trim, finish, or unclosed buyer correction and escalating to pattern engineer, sample room head, merchandising, or QA.', 1),
  ('LFA-CAP-SUB002-MAKE', 'Footwear Cutting, Stitching, Lasting, Sole Bonding, WIP, and Packing Control Capability', 'Learner can track cutting issue slip, upper stitching plan, lasting checklist, sole bonding log, WIP movement, and packing readiness using upper stitching line plan; lasting and sole bonding log to produce updated WIP status, defect log, rework routing, and QA handoff while identifying poor bond, open seam, wrong size, shade mismatch, sole misalignment, or rework delay and escalating to production supervisor, QA, or merchandising.', 2),
  ('LFA-CAP-SUB002-QA', 'Footwear AQL, BIS/QCO, Fit, Bond, Defect, and Shipment Release Capability', 'Learner can inspect footwear fit, bond, stitch, material, BIS/QCO checklist, AQL status, and shipment readiness using AQL shoe inspection sheet; BIS QCO checklist; lasting and sole bonding log to produce defect-classified hold/release note and shipment release handoff while identifying critical defect, failed bond, fit issue, QCO evidence gap, or packaging/labeling error and escalating to QA manager, production supervisor, merchandising, or compliance executive.', 3),
  ('LFA-CAP-SUB002-MERCH', 'Footwear Costing, Buyer Comment, Sourcing, Order File, and Shipment Handoff Capability', 'Learner can coordinate buyer comments, costing basis, sourcing status, order file, and shipment-readiness evidence using footwear CAD pattern file; BIS QCO checklist; AQL shoe inspection sheet to produce closed order file, buyer comment tracker, sourcing handoff, and shipment documentation pack while identifying wrong cost basis, missing buyer approval, supplier delay, unclosed sample comment, or shipment document gap and escalating to footwear merchandiser, sourcing executive, production planner, QA, or export coordinator.', 4),
  ('LFA-CAP-SUB002-COMPLIANCE', 'Footwear BIS/QCO and Buyer Compliance Evidence Support Capability', 'Learner can verify BIS/QCO checklist, AQL status, bond evidence, buyer rule, and compliance escalation need using BIS QCO checklist; AQL shoe inspection sheet; lasting and sole bonding log to produce compliance evidence note and QA handoff for shipment release while identifying missing BIS/QCO evidence, failed AQL status, bond failure, or unsupported buyer compliance claim and escalating to QA manager, compliance executive, or buyer coordinator.', 5),
  ('LFA-CAP-SUB003-SAMPLE', 'Polymeric Footwear Material, Mould, Outsole, and Sample Approval Capability', 'Learner can review EVA/PU/PVC/rubber specification, mould design, outsole sample, size/spec sheet, and buyer sample comment using mould setup card; compound mixing sheet; outsole test record to produce approved polymeric footwear sample correction and buyer handoff while identifying wrong material grade, mould mismatch, outsole size variation, finish defect, or unclosed sample correction and escalating to mould development technician, sample coordinator, QA, or buyer coordinator.', 1),
  ('LFA-CAP-SUB003-MAKE', 'Material Mixing, Mould Setup, Curing, Injection/Compression, and Batch Control Capability', 'Learner can control material specification, compound mixing sheet, mould setup card, curing record, and injection/compression cycle log using compound mixing sheet; mould setup card; curing or injection cycle log to produce updated batch movement record, cycle log, and dispatch readiness status while identifying mixing deviation, mould defect, curing issue, flash, sink mark, size variation, or surface defect and escalating to moulding supervisor, material owner, production supervisor, or QA.', 2),
  ('LFA-CAP-SUB003-QA', 'Polymeric Footwear QCO, Outsole, Visual Defect, Curing Defect, and Dispatch Inspection Capability', 'Learner can inspect QCO checklist, outsole condition, curing evidence, visual defect status, and dispatch labeling using polymeric footwear QCO checklist; outsole test record; curing or injection cycle log to produce dispatch hold/release recommendation and defect classification handoff while identifying moulding defect, curing defect, material issue, size variation, finish defect, or documentation gap and escalating to QA, moulding supervisor, material owner, or dispatch coordinator.', 3),
  ('LFA-CAP-SUB003-MERCH', 'Polymeric Footwear Buyer, Supplier, Dispatch, and Order Handoff Capability', 'Learner can coordinate buyer order, supplier handoff, dispatch checklist, material/mould sample status, and delivery exception using mould setup card; polymeric footwear QCO checklist; component dispatch inspection to produce closed supplier/order handoff and dispatch coordination pack while identifying buyer change, supplier delay, mould/spec mismatch, missing dispatch evidence, or order-document gap and escalating to polymeric footwear merchandiser, supplier coordinator, QA, or dispatch owner.', 4),
  ('LFA-CAP-SUB003-BATCH', 'Polymeric Footwear Batch Identity, Mould Defect, and Production Deviation Control Capability', 'Learner can verify batch identity, mould condition, material deviation note, curing/cycle log, and escalation evidence using compound mixing sheet; mould setup card; curing or injection cycle log to produce batch deviation record and production escalation note while identifying wrong batch identity, mould damage, curing deviation, cycle-setting error, or material mismatch and escalating to production supervisor, material owner, moulding supervisor, or QA.', 5),
  ('LFA-CAP-SUB004-SAMPLE', 'Bag, Wallet, Belt, Pattern Panel, Hardware, Lining, and Buyer Sample Approval Capability', 'Learner can review pattern panel, trim BOM, lining specification, hardware requirement, edge finish expectation, and buyer comments using bag pattern file; trim BOM; sample room tracker to produce corrected leather-goods sample evidence and buyer approval handoff while identifying panel mismatch, wrong trim, hardware mismatch, lining issue, edge finish mismatch, or unclosed buyer comment and escalating to sample coordinator, pattern maker, QA, or merchandiser.', 1),
  ('LFA-CAP-SUB004-MAKE', 'Leather Goods Cutting, Skiving, Stitching, Edge Painting, Hardware Fitment, and Assembly Control Capability', 'Learner can control cutting panel issue, skiving instruction, stitch record, edge-paint record, hardware fitment, and assembly status using bag pattern file; trim BOM; skiving and edge-painting log to produce updated WIP/rework record, assembly status, and QA handoff while identifying panel mismatch, poor edge finish, hardware mismatch, stitch defect, lining defect, or logo placement error and escalating to cutting supervisor, skiving operator, stitching supervisor, QA, or merchandising.', 2),
  ('LFA-CAP-SUB004-QA', 'Leather Goods AQL, Stitch, Edge Finish, Hardware, Packaging, and Buyer Release Capability', 'Learner can inspect stitch quality, edge finish, hardware placement, lining, logo, packaging, and AQL status using final accessory AQL sheet; skiving and edge-painting log; trim BOM to produce defect-classified hold/release note and buyer release handoff while identifying panel defect, hardware defect, edge finish failure, stitch defect, packing gap, or documentation gap and escalating to QA lead, production supervisor, buyer coordinator, or packing owner.', 3),
  ('LFA-CAP-SUB004-MERCH', 'Leather Goods Costing, Buyer Comment, Trim Sourcing, Order File, and Export Handoff Capability', 'Learner can coordinate costing basis, buyer comment tracker, trim sourcing record, order file, and export checklist using trim BOM; sample room tracker; final accessory AQL sheet to produce closed buyer/order handoff, trim sourcing update, and export documentation pack while identifying wrong trim cost, unclosed buyer comment, missing hardware approval, or export document gap and escalating to leather goods merchandiser, sourcing executive, QA, production planner, or export coordinator.', 4),
  ('LFA-CAP-SUB004-REWORK', 'Leather Goods Defect, Rework, Buyer Correction, and Handoff Closure Capability', 'Learner can classify leather-goods defects, record rework status, verify buyer correction closure, and prepare QA handoff using final accessory AQL sheet; skiving and edge-painting log; sample room tracker to produce closed rework note, buyer correction update, and QA handoff while identifying repeat edge defect, stitch defect, hardware mismatch, buyer correction gap, or unresolved rework and escalating to QA lead, production supervisor, or buyer coordinator.', 5),
  ('LFA-CAP-SUB005-SAMPLE', 'Leather Garment/Glove Pattern, Panel Matching, Fit Sample, and Buyer Approval Capability', 'Learner can review garment/glove pattern, panel matching record, fit sample comments, measurement specification, and buyer approval status using garment pattern file; panel cutting marker; fit sample comments to produce corrected fit/sample evidence and buyer approval handoff while identifying panel mismatch, measurement deviation, fit issue, wrong pattern reference, or unclosed buyer fit comment and escalating to pattern maker, fit sample coordinator, QA, or buyer coordinator.', 1),
  ('LFA-CAP-SUB005-MAKE', 'Garment/Glove Cutting, Sewing, Lining Attachment, Measurement Control, and Packing Capability', 'Learner can control cutting marker, panel matching, sewing line defect log, lining attachment, measurement sheet, and packing readiness using panel cutting marker; sewing line defect log; measurement and AQL sheet to produce updated sewing/WIP status, measurement evidence, and inspection handoff while identifying shade mismatch, wrong panel, stitch defect, poor fit, measurement deviation, or lining issue and escalating to sewing supervisor, measurement QA, merchandising, or packing owner.', 2),
  ('LFA-CAP-SUB005-QA', 'Garment/Glove AQL, Fit, Measurement, Stitch, Defect, and Export Release Capability', 'Learner can inspect measurement sheet, fit sample comments, AQL status, stitch defects, panel matching, finishing, and export packing using measurement and AQL sheet; fit sample comments; sewing line defect log to produce hold/release recommendation and export release handoff while identifying fit failure, measurement deviation, stitch defect, shade mismatch, lining defect, or buyer correction issue and escalating to QA, production supervisor, buyer coordinator, or export packing owner.', 3),
  ('LFA-CAP-SUB005-MERCH', 'Garment/Glove Buyer Fit Comment, Costing, Order, Packing, and Export Handoff Capability', 'Learner can coordinate buyer fit comments, costing status, order file, packing checklist, and export handoff evidence using fit sample comments; measurement and AQL sheet; garment pattern file to produce closed buyer fit comment tracker, order file update, and export handoff pack while identifying unclosed fit comment, wrong measurement spec, costing gap, order-file mismatch, or export packing gap and escalating to garment/glove merchandiser, QA, production planner, or export coordinator.', 4),
  ('LFA-CAP-SUB005-FIT', 'Fit, Measurement Deviation, Buyer Correction, and Rework Closure Capability', 'Learner can verify fit comments, measurement deviation, rework status, defect closure, and buyer correction evidence using fit sample comments; measurement and AQL sheet; sewing line defect log to produce fit/rework closure note and buyer correction handoff while identifying repeated fit failure, unresolved measurement deviation, missing rework closure, or buyer correction gap and escalating to measurement QA, production supervisor, or buyer coordinator.', 5),
  ('LFA-CAP-SUB006-SAMPLE', 'Saddlery/Harness Strap, Pattern, Hardware, and Buyer Sample Preparation Capability', 'Learner can review strap cutting template, hardware specification, harness sample note, and buyer quality requirement using strap cutting template; hardware strength checklist to produce controlled buyer sample record with strap/hardware correction notes while identifying strap length error, hardware mismatch, rivet specification issue, or stitch requirement gap and escalating to saddlery sample coordinator, heavy-leather template maker, QA, or buyer documentation owner.', 1),
  ('LFA-CAP-SUB006-MAKE', 'Heavy-Leather Cutting, Strap Preparation, Stitching, Riveting, and Assembly Control Capability', 'Learner can control heavy-leather cutting sheet, strap preparation record, rivet press setting, stitching requirement, and assembly log using strap cutting template; rivet press setting record; saddle or harness assembly log to produce updated assembly log, controlled rework note, and QA handoff while identifying weak stitch, incorrect rivet, strap length error, hardware mismatch, or finish damage and escalating to saddlery supervisor, QA, buyer documentation owner, or production owner.', 2),
  ('LFA-CAP-SUB006-QA', 'Saddlery/Harness Stitch Strength, Hardware Safety, Pull Test, and Export Quality Capability', 'Learner can inspect stitch strength, hardware safety checklist, strap alignment, pull-test result, and export quality evidence using hardware strength checklist; pull test report; saddle or harness assembly log to produce controlled hold/release note and export-quality handoff while identifying strength failure, hardware safety issue, strap alignment defect, or rivet/buckle fitment issue and escalating to QA inspector, production owner, buyer documentation owner, or export coordinator.', 3),
  ('LFA-CAP-SUB006-MERCH', 'Controlled Saddlery/Harness Buyer Documentation and Export Coordination Capability', 'Learner can coordinate buyer documentation tracker, controlled order references, export packing checklist, and quality evidence using hardware strength checklist; pull test report; saddle or harness assembly log to produce controlled buyer/export documentation handoff pack while identifying missing buyer document, incomplete export pack, unresolved QA note, or unsupported role-depth claim and escalating to export coordinator, buyer documentation assistant, QA, or production owner.', 4),
  ('LFA-CAP-SUB006-SAFETY', 'Controlled Strength, Hardware Safety, Defect, and Rework Escalation Capability', 'Learner can verify pull-test issue, hardware defect, stitch failure, rework note, and controlled escalation requirement using pull test report; hardware strength checklist; rivet press setting record to produce controlled safety/rework escalation note and QA release decision while identifying failed pull test, unsafe hardware, stitch failure, rivet issue, or rework not closed and escalating to QA inspector, production owner, buyer documentation owner, or controlled evidence owner.', 5),
  ('LFA-CAP-SUB007-SAMPLE', 'Upper, Component BOM, Insole/Outsole, Supplier Sample, and Buyer Component Approval Capability', 'Learner can review component BOM, upper pattern, supplier sample, insole/outsole specification, and buyer component comment using component BOM; upper stitching plan; bonding test record to produce approved component sample evidence and buyer handoff while identifying wrong component specification, supplier sample mismatch, bonding issue, size/spec deviation, or unclosed buyer comment and escalating to upper developer, supplier sample coordinator, component QA, or buyer handoff owner.', 1),
  ('LFA-CAP-SUB007-MAKE', 'Upper Cutting, Skiving, Stitching, Component Preparation, Batch Card, and Dispatch Control Capability', 'Learner can control upper cutting slip, skiving record, upper stitching plan, sole/insole batch card, component matching, and dispatch readiness using upper stitching plan; sole or insole batch card; component BOM to produce updated component batch card, rework routing, and dispatch status while identifying wrong component, stitching defect, skiving error, bonding sample issue, supplier mismatch, or size/spec deviation and escalating to component production supervisor, supplier quality, or buyer handoff owner.', 2),
  ('LFA-CAP-SUB007-QA', 'Component Supplier Quality, Bonding Sample, Dispatch Inspection, Defect, and Buyer Handoff Capability', 'Learner can inspect component specification, bonding sample, supplier quality record, component inspection status, dispatch labeling, and buyer handoff record using bonding test record; component dispatch inspection; component BOM to produce dispatch hold/release recommendation and buyer handoff record while identifying supplier defect, bonding failure, stitch defect, size deviation, finish defect, component mismatch, or documentation issue and escalating to component QA, supplier coordinator, or buyer handoff owner.', 3),
  ('LFA-CAP-SUB007-MERCH', 'Footwear Component Buyer, Supplier, BOM, Dispatch, and Handoff Coordination Capability', 'Learner can coordinate buyer component comments, supplier tracker, BOM change record, dispatch plan, and buyer handoff evidence using component BOM; component dispatch inspection; upper stitching plan to produce closed buyer/supplier handoff, updated BOM record, and dispatch coordination pack while identifying unclosed buyer comment, supplier delay, incorrect BOM, or dispatch label gap and escalating to component merchandiser, supplier coordinator, component QA, or dispatch owner.', 4),
  ('LFA-CAP-SUB007-SUPPLIER', 'Supplier Quality, Component Mismatch, Bonding Issue, and Dispatch Escalation Capability', 'Learner can verify supplier quality check, component mismatch note, bonding issue, dispatch inspection status, and escalation need using component BOM; bonding test record; component dispatch inspection to produce supplier-quality escalation note and corrected dispatch handoff while identifying supplier defect, component mismatch, bonding issue, dispatch inspection failure, or label/documentation gap and escalating to component QA, supplier coordinator, dispatch owner, or buyer handoff owner.', 5),
  ('GJ-CAP001', 'Rough parcel intake and planning capability', 'Learner can verify rough parcel ID, weight and buyer instruction before planning entry, check inclusion notes and expected yield against rough parcel condition, record sawing-risk note and planning handoff status in the planning sheet, and hold and escalate parcel identity, yield or buyer-instruction mismatch using Rough parcel planning sheet and buyer-ready sawing-plan handoff note; final approval remains with Planning Head / Production Manager / buyer-authorised release authority and exceptions must be escalated when parcel ID mismatch, weight variance, missing buyer instruction, high breakage risk or planning dispute.', 1),
  ('GJ-CAP002', 'Yield estimate and sawing-plan review capability', 'Learner can match inclusion diagram with proposed sawing line before plan release, recommend yield plan only after shape target and risk note are reconciled, record manager-review status for the sawing-plan handoff, and escalate yield variance, unclear shape target or challenged sawing plan using Yield estimate sheet and sawing-plan review note; final approval remains with Planning Head / Production Manager and exceptions must be escalated when yield variance beyond tolerance, breakage-risk warning, unclear shape target or manager challenge.', 2),
  ('GJ-CAP003', 'Polishing allocation and weight-loss tracking capability', 'Learner can confirm packet ID and starting weight before polishing allocation, check polishing bench assignment against job card and rework instruction, record closing weight, weight-loss variance and rework status, and escalate excess loss, broken stone, packet mismatch or QC rejection using Polishing job card, packet movement entry and weight-loss tracker; final approval remains with Production Manager / Diamond QC Head and exceptions must be escalated when unexpected weight loss, broken stone, packet movement gap, QC rejection or rework dispute.', 1),
  ('GJ-CAP004', 'QC grading and packet release handoff capability', 'Learner can match polished packet ID, weight and planning record before grading, inspect visible quality and grade notes against buyer requirement, record rework, hold or release-handoff status on the QC sheet, and escalate grade conflict, packet identity issue or buyer-release challenge using QC grading sheet and buyer release hold or release handoff note; final approval remains with Diamond QC Head / Buyer-authorised release authority and exceptions must be escalated when grade conflict, buyer-grade dispute, packet identity mismatch, rework decision or release challenge.', 1),
  ('GJ-CAP005', 'LGD growth batch record maintenance capability', 'Learner can open LGD batch record with batch ID, equipment and seed reference, check growth-stage entry against process run sheet and traceability chain, record abnormal growth event and batch handoff note, and escalate batch identity, parameter or traceability exception before release using LGD batch record and traceability handoff note; final approval remains with LGD Production Manager / Lab or Disclosure Compliance Authority and exceptions must be escalated when batch ID mismatch, missing parameter record, abnormal growth event or traceability gap.', 1),
  ('GJ-CAP006', 'Process parameter tracking capability', 'Learner can enter run ID, process stage and required equipment readings, check operating readings against allowed range and batch link, record equipment alarm, abnormal reading and corrective note, and escalate out-of-range parameter or unlinked run record using Equipment parameter sheet and exception log; final approval remains with LGD Production Manager / Process Engineer and exceptions must be escalated when out-of-range reading, missing batch link, equipment alarm or abnormal growth result.', 2),
  ('GJ-CAP007', 'Screening and traceability handoff capability', 'Learner can verify LGD packet ID and processing stage before screening handoff, check screening status and report dependency before next movement, record packet movement, screening result and next-process handoff, and escalate screening mismatch, report dependency gap or packet ID conflict using Screening handoff sheet and processing movement record; final approval remains with Processing Manager / Disclosure Compliance Coordinator and exceptions must be escalated when screening mismatch, inscription/report dependency gap, packet ID conflict or process hold.', 1),
  ('GJ-CAP008', 'Report inscription and disclosure verification capability', 'Learner can match LGD report number with packet ID and inscription record, check HPHT/CVD disclosure wording against buyer documentation requirement, record report, inscription and disclosure verification status, and escalate report mismatch, missing inscription or unsupported origin claim using Inscription verification sheet and buyer disclosure checklist; final approval remains with Disclosure Compliance Manager / Gem Lab or Brand Compliance Authority and exceptions must be escalated when hPHT/CVD identity issue, report mismatch, inscription mismatch or undisclosed LGD risk.', 1),
  ('GJ-CAP009', 'CAD design-to-production handoff capability', 'Learner can create CAD model version from approved design brief and size requirement, check stone placement and metal weight estimate before production handoff, record CAD version, customer approval reference and production handoff note, and escalate design mismatch, stone-size conflict or weight-estimate challenge using CAD design file and production handoff note; final approval remains with Design Head / Customer Approval Authority / Production Manager and exceptions must be escalated when customer design mismatch, stone-size conflict, weight-estimate challenge or missing approval.', 1),
  ('GJ-CAP010', 'Casting and bench job-card movement capability', 'Learner can verify production job card, metal issue and cast component identity, check casting defect log before releasing component to bench work, record gold issue, return weight and gold-loss variance, and escalate casting defect, unexplained gold loss or job-card mismatch using Production job card, casting defect log and gold-loss register; final approval remains with Production Manager / Gold Control or Manufacturing QA Authority and exceptions must be escalated when casting defect, unexplained gold loss, job-card mismatch or rework dispute.', 1),
  ('GJ-CAP011', 'Stone setting and rework tracking capability', 'Learner can match stone issue record with stone-setting checklist before setting, inspect setting quality and rework instruction against job card, record missing-stone, loose-setting or rework status, and escalate stone-setting defect, missing stone or customer design mismatch using Stone-setting checklist and rework note; final approval remains with Bench Manufacturing Supervisor / Jewellery QA Manager and exceptions must be escalated when stone-setting defect, missing stone, rework conflict or customer design mismatch.', 2),
  ('GJ-CAP012', 'Finished jewellery QC and dispatch readiness capability', 'Learner can inspect finished jewellery against job card, weight and customer specification, check stone security, finish quality and hallmark/HUID requirement, record QC result, defect note and dispatch readiness status, and hold and escalate defect, weight mismatch, missing HUID or dispatch conflict using Finished QC checklist and dispatch hold or release note; final approval remains with Jewellery QA Manager / Dispatch Manager / Hallmarking Authority where applicable and exceptions must be escalated when finish defect, stone loss, weight mismatch, hallmark/HUID dependency or dispatch hold.', 1),
  ('GJ-CAP013', 'Rough gemstone procurement and assortment capability', 'Learner can verify rough gemstone supplier reference, lot ID and declared weight, assort rough gemstones by colour, size, clarity cue and cutting suitability, record procurement condition note and assortment handoff status, and escalate supplier mismatch, treatment suspicion or procurement value dispute using Rough gemstone intake sheet and assortment register; final approval remains with Gemstone Procurement Head / Gemologist / Buyer Approval Authority and exceptions must be escalated when supplier document gap, parcel identity issue, treatment suspicion or price dispute.', 1),
  ('GJ-CAP014', 'Cutting shaping and engraving job control capability', 'Learner can match gemstone lot ID and shape requirement before cutting job card issue, check cutting, shaping or engraving instruction against stone condition, record cutting yield, shape outcome and rework requirement, and escalate damaged stone, yield variance, wrong shape or treatment concern using Cutting job card and cutting-loss tracker; final approval remains with Gemstone Production Manager / Gemologist and exceptions must be escalated when breakage, high cutting loss, shape mismatch, size mismatch or treatment concern.', 1),
  ('GJ-CAP015', 'Treatment disclosure and grading record capability', 'Learner can verify gemstone lot ID before treatment-disclosure review, check visible treatment indicators and grading notes against disclosure requirement, record grade, treatment disclosure status and buyer note, and escalate treatment-disclosure uncertainty, grade conflict or buyer challenge using Treatment disclosure note and grading sheet; final approval remains with Gemologist / Gem Lab Authority / Wholesale Release Manager and exceptions must be escalated when treatment-disclosure gap, grade conflict, lab report mismatch or buyer query.', 1),
  ('GJ-CAP016', 'Wholesale parcel release handoff capability', 'Learner can match wholesale parcel ID, grade sheet and buyer requirement before release, check parcel composition, counts and treatment note before buyer handoff, record wholesale release status and buyer handoff note, and escalate parcel count variance, disclosure gap or buyer-grade dispute using Wholesale parcel register and buyer handoff note; final approval remains with Wholesale Release Manager / Gemologist and exceptions must be escalated when parcel count mismatch, buyer-grade dispute, treatment disclosure issue or missing handoff owner.', 2),
  ('GJ-CAP017', 'SKU tray and stock control capability', 'Learner can match SKU tray count, product tag and HUID before stock update, record tray movement, stock variance and omnichannel hold status, check POS or online stock status before customer promise, and escalate SKU mismatch, tray count gap, HUID conflict or stock hold using SKU tray register and stock variance note; final approval remains with Store Manager / Inventory Control Manager and exceptions must be escalated when sKU mismatch, tray count gap, tag issue, HUID mismatch or omnichannel hold.', 1),
  ('GJ-CAP018', 'Customer consultation and product explanation capability', 'Learner can capture customer requirement, budget range and product-use context, check product tag, HUID and quality information before explanation, record product explanation, estimate and customer acknowledgement, and escalate unsupported purity claim, discount exception or pricing dispute using Customer consultation note and estimate record; final approval remains with Store Manager / Jewellery Expert / Compliance Authority and exceptions must be escalated when unsupported certification claim, customer dispute, HUID query or pricing exception.', 1),
  ('GJ-CAP019', 'Old-gold exchange and buyback evidence collection capability', 'Learner can capture customer invoice, ID/KYC and old-gold item details before valuation, check declared weight, purity evidence and exchange-policy requirement, record buyback evidence, valuation support note and customer acknowledgement, and escalate valuation dispute, missing KYC, invoice gap or purity conflict using Exchange/buyback form and old-gold valuation evidence sheet; final approval remains with Store Manager / Valuation Authority / Compliance Authority and exceptions must be escalated when old-gold valuation dispute, invoice/KYC gap, purity mismatch or buyback exception.', 2),
  ('GJ-CAP020', 'Repair intake and service closure capability', 'Learner can record repair item identity, condition photos and customer request, check repair scope, approval requirement and estimated return commitment, record service completion, item condition and closure acknowledgement, and escalate item identity mismatch, service dispute or missing approval using Repair intake form and service closure note; final approval remains with Store Manager / Service Manager and exceptions must be escalated when item identity mismatch, service dispute, missing customer approval or closure mismatch.', 1),
  ('GJ-CAP021', 'Billing and HUID explanation capability', 'Learner can match product tag, invoice details and payment record before billing closure, check HUID explanation requirement against product and invoice, record invoice, HUID explanation and customer confirmation, and escalate invoice mismatch, HUID query, payment failure or compliance hold using POS invoice and HUID explanation checklist; final approval remains with Store Manager / Accounts or Compliance Authority and exceptions must be escalated when invoice mismatch, HUID query, payment failure, customer detail mismatch or compliance exception.', 2),
  ('GJ-CAP022', 'Sample intake and chain-of-custody capability', 'Learner can verify customer reference, sample ID, seal condition and declared weight, check sample packet against intake register and chain-of-custody requirement, record intake status, weight, seal condition and custody handoff, and escalate sample mismatch, damaged seal, duplicate ID or weight discrepancy using Sample intake register and chain-of-custody log; final approval remains with Approved Assaying and Hallmarking Centre authority / Quality Manager and exceptions must be escalated when weight mismatch, damaged seal, missing customer reference, duplicate sample ID or custody gap.', 1),
  ('GJ-CAP023', 'Assay preparation and test documentation capability', 'Learner can prepare assay worksheet with sample ID, metal type and test method reference, check test preparation checklist against sample condition and custody entry, record assay reading, method note and worksheet exception, and escalate sample identity, method, result or worksheet conflict using Assay worksheet and test preparation checklist; final approval remains with Quality Manager / AHC Technical Authority and exceptions must be escalated when sample identity mismatch, test result conflict, method exception or worksheet gap.', 1),
  ('GJ-CAP024', 'HUID hallmark report verification capability', 'Learner can match assay result, sample ID and HUID verification record, check purity result consistency before hallmark report status, record HUID verification status and report hold or release note, and escalate HUID issue, assay result conflict or BIS/AHC non-conformance using HUID verification record and report status note; final approval remains with Approved AHC Authority / Regulatory Authority as applicable and exceptions must be escalated when HUID issue, assay result conflict, sample identity mismatch or BIS/AHC non-conformance.', 1),
  ('GJ-CAP025', 'Non-conformance handling and report hold capability', 'Learner can open non-conformance log with sample, report and exception reason, check report hold note against assay worksheet and HUID record, record investigation route, authority review status and closure condition, and escalate unresolved result conflict, HUID issue or audit exception using Non-conformance log and report hold note; final approval remains with Approved AHC Authority / Regulatory Authority as applicable and exceptions must be escalated when unresolved result conflict, HUID issue, sample identity gap or audit exception.', 2),
  ('GJ-CAP026', 'Buyer order review and costing capability', 'Learner can match buyer order specification, quantity and delivery timeline, prepare costing support note with sample, delivery and compliance assumptions, record buyer clarification, costing status and commercial handoff, and escalate specification conflict, costing gap or timeline risk using Buyer order sheet and merchandising cost sheet; final approval remains with Merchandising Manager / Commercial Manager and exceptions must be escalated when specification conflict, costing gap, buyer compliance requirement or timeline risk.', 1),
  ('GJ-CAP027', 'Packing-list and invoice reconciliation capability', 'Learner can match buyer order, item count and SKU details against packing list, check commercial invoice value, item description and export document fields, record reconciliation status and missing-document note, and escalate invoice mismatch, packing-list variance or shipment-document conflict using Commercial invoice, packing list and reconciliation note; final approval remains with Export Manager / Commercial Release Authority and exceptions must be escalated when invoice/packing-list mismatch, buyer order mismatch, value conflict or shipment hold.', 1),
  ('GJ-CAP028', 'Export document checklist preparation capability', 'Learner can compile export document checklist with invoice, packing list and buyer compliance items, check chain-of-custody and compliance evidence before readiness mark, record missing-document note and document-pack readiness status, and escalate missing compliance document, chain-of-custody gap or commercial hold using Export document checklist and missing-document note; final approval remains with Export Manager / Compliance Authority and exceptions must be escalated when missing document, compliance gap, chain-of-custody gap or commercial hold.', 2),
  ('GJ-CAP029', 'Dispatch readiness and shipment hold escalation capability', 'Learner can confirm dispatch tracker against shipment instruction and document checklist, check payment-term issue and shipment hold note before release routing, record dispatch readiness, hold reason and next owner, and escalate shipment hold, payment-term issue or buyer compliance gap using Dispatch tracker and shipment hold note; final approval remains with Export Manager / Commercial Release Authority and exceptions must be escalated when shipment hold, payment-term issue, missing document or buyer compliance gap.', 3),
  ('GJ-CAP030', 'Buyer compliance and chain-of-custody evidence tracking capability', 'Learner can verify trading parcel ID, deal note and buyer compliance requirement, check chain-of-custody evidence before deal confirmation handoff, record buyer compliance status, custody evidence and payment-term note, and escalate buyer compliance gap, custody gap or deal confirmation dispute using Buyer compliance checklist and chain-of-custody evidence file; final approval remains with Trading Head / Compliance Authority / Commercial Manager and exceptions must be escalated when buyer compliance gap, chain-of-custody gap, payment-term issue or deal confirmation dispute.', 1),
  ('ES-CAP001', 'Prepare RTL requirement-to-lint handoff evidence', 'Works with RTL requirement package and block interface assumptions using EDA environment, RTL editor, lint/CDC checker, requirements tracker, version control to produce RTL handoff package with requirement trace, lint/CDC status, open issue list, owner, and escalation note. Handles Missing requirement ID, conflicting interface assumption, unresolved lint/CDC warning, or stale RTL revision and escalates when Missing/conflicting requirement, unresolved lint/CDC warning, unclear owner, or final design-signoff request. Learner can prepare design evidence and escalation notes; cannot approve final architecture, tape-out, silicon signoff, or customer release.', 1),
  ('ES-CAP003', 'Review physical design constraints, timing risk, and DRC/LVS evidence', 'Works with Timing path, floorplan block, constraint exception, DRC/LVS issue list using Synthesis/place-route tool, static timing report, DRC/LVS checker, constraint manager, version control to produce Physical implementation review note with timing/DRC/LVS status, constraint issue list, ECO owner, and escalation item. Handles Constraint mismatch, timing violation, DRC/LVS error, stale ECO, or unapproved exception and escalates when Timing/DRC/LVS blocker, exception without owner, ECO mismatch, or tape-out/signoff request. Learner can prepare implementation evidence; cannot approve tape-out package, final signoff, or silicon release.', 2),
  ('ES-CAP002', 'Triage pre-silicon regression failure and coverage-gap evidence', 'Works with Failed regression case, assertion failure, coverage gap, and linked RTL requirement using Simulation tool, regression dashboard, coverage database, assertion log, waveform viewer, defect tracker to produce Regression triage note with failed test ID, coverage impact, reproduction evidence, defect owner, and next action. Handles Repeated regression failure, untriaged assertion, unexplained coverage hole, or environment mismatch and escalates when Repeated failure across builds, blocked coverage target, unknown assertion root cause, or waiver request. Learner can triage and document verification evidence; cannot approve final verification closure or signoff waiver.', 1),
  ('ES-CAP004', 'Review wafer recipe SPC and metrology benchmark evidence', 'Works with Wafer recipe, process parameter, SPC trend, metrology result, and wafer traveler using Recipe management system, MES, SPC dashboard, metrology report, wafer traveler to produce Benchmark recipe review note with parameter status, SPC signal, metrology evidence, and escalation recommendation. Handles Recipe mismatch, SPC out-of-control signal, metrology drift, missing traveler step, or unapproved recipe change and escalates when SPC out-of-control signal, recipe mismatch, metrology breach, or hold/release authority needed. Benchmark/future-facing only; learner cannot release process recipe, override cleanroom controls, or approve wafer lot disposition.', 1),
  ('ES-CAP005', 'Triage fab equipment alarms and process-excursion benchmark evidence', 'Works with Equipment alarm, process parameter excursion, PM record, affected wafer lot using Equipment logbook, MES, alarm dashboard, SPC chart, metrology comparison report to produce Equipment/process alarm triage note with alarm class, lot impact, parameter trend, and escalation owner. Handles Critical alarm, repeated tool fault, missing PM signoff, tool matching failure, or affected lot uncertainty and escalates when Safety/quality critical alarm, failed tool matching, unclear lot impact, or equipment disposition needed. Benchmark/future-facing only; learner cannot release equipment to production, bypass interlocks, or approve tool disposition.', 1),
  ('ES-CAP006', 'Review wafer yield-map and defect-metrology benchmark evidence', 'Works with Wafer map, defect image/log, metrology trend, yield Pareto, and engineer review summary using Yield analysis system, metrology tool output, defect review station, SPC dashboard, wafer map viewer to produce Yield/metrology defect review summary with affected lot, defect class, trend, suspected cause, and escalation owner. Handles Abnormal defect cluster, metrology shift, unexplained yield loss, or missing disposition evidence and escalates when Unexplained yield loss, metrology trend breach, defect excursion, or lot disposition request. Benchmark/future-facing only; learner cannot approve process change, lot release, or fab yield disposition.', 2),
  ('ES-CAP007', 'Prepare OSAT package traveler and assembly defect evidence', 'Works with Package lot traveler, bond diagram, assembly checklist, defect log using Lot traveler system, package assembly record, wire-bond/die-attach log, inspection station to produce Package assembly traveler review note with lot ID, assembly step status, defect evidence, and escalation owner. Handles Missing traveler step, bond diagram mismatch, assembly defect, incomplete checklist, or lot-history gap and escalates when Missing traveler step, mismatched bond diagram, repeated assembly defect, or shipment/customer disposition request. Controlled pathway only; learner cannot approve package qualification, customer release, or lot shipment disposition.', 1),
  ('ES-CAP008', 'Triage ATE bin-failure and retest evidence', 'Works with ATE log, bin summary, failed parameter, retest status, and lot history using ATE system, bin summary dashboard, test program log, lot history record, retest tracker to produce ATE triage note with failed parameter, bin code, affected lot, retest disposition, and escalation owner. Handles Abnormal bin fallout, failed parameter trend, retest mismatch, missing lot history, or invalid test program version and escalates when Repeated bin failure, invalid test program version, unclear retest disposition, or customer qualification request. Controlled pathway only; learner cannot approve final test disposition, customer shipment, or product release.', 1),
  ('ES-CAP009', 'Assemble reliability qualification chamber evidence pack', 'Works with Reliability chamber log, stress condition, failure record, qualification summary using Reliability chamber record, stress-test log, failure analysis note, qualification tracker to produce Reliability evidence pack with condition, sample/lot ID, failure status, qualification summary, and escalation owner. Handles Missing stress condition, chamber excursion, failed sample, incomplete failure record, or qualification gap and escalates when Chamber excursion, failed qualification sample, missing stress condition, or reliability release request. Controlled pathway only; learner cannot approve reliability release, customer qualification, or lot shipment.', 2),
  ('ES-CAP010', 'Review display module process and optical-defect benchmark evidence', 'Works with Panel/module process sheet, optical inspection log, defect classification using Display process record, optical inspection log, defect classification sheet, module traveler to produce Display module process evidence review note with process status, optical defect class, and escalation item. Handles Panel defect, optical non-uniformity, missing process step, unclassified defect, or reliability gap and escalates when Unclassified optical defect, process step gap, repeated panel issue, or release/qualification request. Benchmark/future-facing only; learner cannot approve display process release, panel qualification, or product acceptance.', 1),
  ('ES-CAP011', 'Review optical inspection and display reliability benchmark evidence', 'Works with Brightness/uniformity data, inspection image, test condition, reliability note using Optical inspection system, brightness/uniformity dataset, display reliability record, image log to produce Optical inspection/reliability review note with test condition, parameter result, defect image, and escalation owner. Handles Brightness deviation, uniformity failure, image defect, missing test condition, or reliability excursion and escalates when Brightness/uniformity breach, missing test condition, repeated optical defect, or display qualification request. Benchmark/future-facing only; learner cannot approve reliability release, module acceptance, or India-current manufacturing claim.', 2),
  ('ES-CAP012', 'Summarize optoelectronic device parameter and failure-mode benchmark evidence', 'Works with Optical/electrical test result, optical parameter, failure mode, benchmark evidence sheet using Optoelectronic test bench, optical parameter log, failure-mode sheet, reliability test record to produce Optoelectronic device test summary with parameter result, failure mode, benchmark reference, and escalation item. Handles Optical parameter out of range, missing test condition, device failure mode, or incomplete benchmark reference and escalates when Out-of-range optical parameter, unclear failure mode, missing benchmark evidence, or release/qualification request. Benchmark/future-facing only; learner cannot approve device qualification, customer acceptance, or production release.', 1),
  ('ES-CAP013', 'Prepare PCB fabrication readiness and DFM-release evidence', 'Works with Gerber/CAM file, stack-up, DFM issue, manufacturing release checklist using CAM tool, Gerber viewer, DFM checker, BOM/stack-up record, manufacturing release tracker to produce PCB fabrication readiness checklist with Gerber revision, DFM issue list, stack-up status, and escalation owner. Handles Gerber revision mismatch, stack-up conflict, unresolved DFM issue, or missing release checklist and escalates when Revision mismatch, unresolved DFM blocker, stack-up conflict, or customer/plant release authority request. Learner can prepare manufacturing evidence; cannot approve customer acceptance, supplier commercial approval, or plant-level process release.', 1),
  ('ES-CAP014', 'Verify component lot traceability and incoming-quality evidence', 'Works with Supplier lot, certificate of conformance, inspection record, defect note using ERP/MES receiving record, supplier CoC, component traceability file, inspection log to produce Incoming component quality note with supplier lot, CoC status, inspection result, defect evidence, and escalation item. Handles Missing CoC, supplier lot mismatch, incoming defect, counterfeit risk, or traceability gap and escalates when Lot mismatch, missing CoC, repeated supplier defect, counterfeit concern, or supplier approval request. Learner can prepare quality evidence; cannot approve supplier commercial status, customer acceptance, or final disposition owner action.', 2),
  ('ES-CAP015', 'Document PCB defect disposition and IPC-style inspection evidence', 'Works with PCB defect photo, IPC reference, inspection result, rework/hold note using IPC inspection reference, microscope/visual inspection record, defect photo log, quality system to produce PCB defect disposition note with defect type, IPC reference, inspection result, rework/hold status, and escalation owner. Handles Solder defect, plating issue, dimensional issue, missing defect photo, or unclear disposition and escalates when Repeated defect, IPC acceptability dispute, missing photo evidence, or customer acceptance/disposition request. Learner can prepare defect evidence and recommendation; cannot approve customer acceptance or final quality disposition.', 2),
  ('ES-CAP017', 'Document PCBA AOI/ICT/FCT repair and retest disposition', 'Works with AOI defect, ICT/FCT failure, repair note, disposition record using AOI system, ICT/FCT tester, rework log, repair station record, MES quality record to produce PCBA repair/retest disposition note with failure ID, repair action, retest result, and disposition owner. Handles AOI false call, failed ICT/FCT, damaged pad, unresolved repair, or unclear disposition and escalates when Repeated board failure, failed retest, unsafe repair condition, or customer shipment/disposition request. Learner can prepare repair/inspection evidence; cannot approve final disposition or customer shipment.', 3),
  ('ES-CAP018', 'Prepare EMS line-yield Pareto and defect-containment evidence', 'Works with Yield dashboard, DPPM trend, defect Pareto, containment action using MES dashboard, yield report, DPPM tracker, defect Pareto, containment log to produce Line yield containment note with DPPM trend, defect Pareto, containment action, owner, and escalation item. Handles Yield drop, recurring defect, missing containment action, excessive DPPM, or unresolved root cause and escalates when DPPM spike, repeated defect, containment failure, unresolved root cause, or customer shipment risk. Learner can prepare containment evidence; cannot approve production-line change, customer shipment, or CAPA closure.', 4),
  ('ES-CAP016', 'Prepare SMT first-board setup and inspection evidence', 'Works with BOM, PCB revision, feeder list, SMT program version, reflow profile, SPI/AOI/ICT result using SMT program, feeder setup sheet, SPI system, AOI station, ICT tester, MES/ERP to produce First-board approval or hold note with BOM, feeder, program, inspection result, and disposition evidence. Handles BOM mismatch, wrong component polarity, feeder issue, solder bridge, tombstoning, or failed ICT and escalates when Unapproved ECO, repeated AOI defect, PCB/BOM revision mismatch, failed ICT, or mass-production release request. Learner can prepare first-board evidence; cannot approve mass production release or customer shipment.', 1),
  ('ES-CAP020', 'Control NPI/ECO build-readiness and deviation evidence', 'Works with ECO/ECN, pilot build sheet, deviation log, release checklist using ECO/ECN tracker, NPI build sheet, deviation log, yield report, release checklist to produce NPI/ECO build-readiness control note with ECO status, deviation, pilot result, release checklist, and owner. Handles Unapproved ECO, missing deviation approval, pilot build failure, stale revision, or incomplete checklist and escalates when Unapproved ECO/ECN, pilot failure, unresolved deviation, or production release authority request. Learner can prepare documentation evidence; cannot approve customer acceptance, export release, field recall, or shipment release.', 2),
  ('ES-CAP019', 'Prepare device assembly readiness and line-checkpoint evidence', 'Works with Assembly work instruction, BOM, line readiness sheet, quality checkpoint using Assembly work instruction system, line readiness checklist, ERP/MES record, quality checkpoint log to produce Device assembly readiness review note with BOM, WI status, line readiness, quality checkpoint, and escalation item. Handles Missing work instruction, BOM mismatch, line readiness gap, quality checkpoint miss, or resource constraint and escalates when Missing WI/BOM revision, failed line readiness checkpoint, quality gap, or plant/customer release request. Restricted to LSEM/device manufacturing operations; learner cannot approve plant-level release, device customer acceptance, or field recall action.', 1),
  ('ES-CAP021', 'Prepare finished-goods test documentation and shipment-readiness evidence', 'Works with Test record, packing/export checklist, final inspection evidence using Final test system, packing checklist, ERP/MES shipment record, inspection evidence repository to produce Finished-goods quality documentation pack with test result, final inspection, packing/export evidence, and escalation item. Handles Missing final test record, packing mismatch, failed final inspection, incomplete export checklist, or traceability gap and escalates when Failed final inspection, missing shipment document, traceability gap, or customer/export release request. Learner can prepare NPI/ECO evidence; final production release, supplier approval, and customer release remain owner authority.', 2),
  ('ES-CAP022', 'Prepare embedded hardware validation evidence and issue trace', 'Works with HIL bench result, firmware log, test script, requirements traceability, issue tracker using HIL bench, firmware log, test script repository, requirements traceability matrix, issue tracker to produce Embedded validation evidence note with requirement ID, test result, firmware/log evidence, issue status, and escalation owner. Handles Failed HIL result, firmware mismatch, missing requirement trace, open issue, or invalid test script and escalates when Failed validation, missing traceability, firmware mismatch, open safety issue, or release/compliance request. Controlled pathway only; learner cannot approve compliance, product safety, or release readiness.', 1),
  ('ES-CAP023', 'Triage power electronics load-test and thermal-failure evidence', 'Works with Load test result, thermal reading, fault log, corrective action note using Load test bench, thermal logger, firmware/fault log, validation tracker, issue tracker to produce Power electronics failure triage note with load condition, thermal result, fault log, corrective action, and escalation item. Handles Thermal excursion, load-test failure, fault-code recurrence, missing corrective action, or safety risk and escalates when Thermal limit breach, repeated fault, safety risk, missing corrective action, or compliance/release request. Controlled pathway only; learner cannot approve safety compliance, customer quality gate, or production release.', 2),
  ('ES-CAP024', 'Assemble APQP/PPAP-style customer-quality gate evidence', 'Works with APQP/PPAP-style checklist, validation matrix, ECO log, customer-gate tracker using Control plan, validation matrix, ECO tracker, customer-gate tracker, quality evidence repository to produce Customer-quality gate evidence pack with requirement, validation result, ECO status, risk item, owner, and escalation note. Handles Missing customer requirement, failed validation, open ECO, incomplete control plan, or unresolved risk item and escalates when Missing customer requirement, failed validation, PPAP/customer approval request, unresolved risk, or gate-blocking evidence gap. Controlled pathway only; learner cannot approve APQP, PPAP, safety compliance, or customer quality gate.', 1),
